            <a name="DESC">
            Greetings! I am selling my level 65 Bard, Half Elf Male of the Vazaelle server. All the expansions are enabled and is elemental planes flagged(Fire, Water, Earth, Air). This bard consists of 90 well spent alternate advancements. He literally has every song pre-god. This includes the ancients from Vex Thal, all the planar songs, Lost Dungeon of Norrath adventure point costed songs, and those nasty rare drop ones from the Shadows of Luclin. This bard has the keys to the Sleeper's Tomb, the Emperor area of Ssraeshza Temple, Old Sebilis, Charasis, and Vex Thal. He also has the Symbol of Torden to begin the Agnarr, The Stormlord event in the Bastion of Thunder. The adventure status of Lost Dungeons of Norrath is; Deepest Guk - 459 Miragul's - 896 Mistmoore - 513 Rujarkian - 309 Takish - 564 Total --- 2741 Vacant points - 429. There are many unique and rare items in the bank of this bard too. Some mentionable no drop items would be; Froglok Reet Crown - Faction with the live Frogloks of Guk is kindly with faction song. Various Medallion pieces for the Veeshan's Peak key. Sword Of Truth. Many, MANY Thurgadin armor pieces, including Chain Legging. Undead Dragon Sinew for the Spirit Wracked Cords quest. Fabled Journeyman's Boots(no longer drop) Beer Goggles(!!!!) Ring of the Shissar(Emp Key.) Various Plane of Sky quest pieces. Many rare droppable rare spells that only drop off the higher content of SoL. He has almost completed the Sigil Earring of Veracity quest, he has all the very rare reports that are the real time sink of the quest. This is the gear of the Bard. The Magelo is http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=747389 . He has many side weapons that include Lava Infused Bludgeon, 17/19 Proc:160DD Firebased Vyzh`Dra's Render Of Souls 21/24 Proc:75 Lifetap Acrylia Handled Broadsword - 16/19 Proc:100 Lifetap UNRESISTABLE And the lesser weapons would be the ToeTwister, Seru Bane, and Shissar Bane. The Misc items of the bard would be Tiny Cloak of the Darkest Night(I personally used it for Swarm Kiting). Voice of the Serpent, +Singing Mod. Mask of Deception - Dark Elf Illusion Mask of the Hunter - Vah Shir Illusion Mask of Obtenebration - Erudite Illusion Iksar-Hide Mask - Iksar Illusion 2 Pots of 10 Dose Gate Potions Singing Steel Gauntlets(Enduring Breath) Singing Steel Helm(Eye of Zomm) Singing Steel Boots(2.5minute lasting Levitation) Lute of the Howler(Werewolf form, +atk) Thunderous Drum of Karana(Most Powerful droppable drums in the game) Bloodstained Flute(I used it to increase the counters removed from Curses. This concludes the description of this Bard. Any questions, please contact me. The method of payment I would prefer are money orders, or through paypal. Thank you, and happy bidding.
